{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$1$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$F$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9bb8c6c410099b25ea503288d41e338ab83c6f2e8f3d388d84cc5659e4c306ca", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:55f5294ac726928905be64410d7ebef0c80f218dbb4c7ddb8a15069e5257443b", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIf <MATH_0001> is a <MATH_0002>-morphism of categories fibred\nin groupoids over <MATH_0003>, then <MATH_0004> induces a functor between\ncategories of formal objects as well.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:037f658da29e9d3f076a264e431e0838e554fe2719c68ce7034de48aaf4c4e48", "unit_id": "tag:07X3:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$F : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$1$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\eta = (R, \\eta_n, g_n)$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\xi_1$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0009": "$F(\\xi_1) \\cong \\eta_1$", "MATH_0010": "$F$", "MATH_0011": "$\\xi = (R, \\xi_n, f_n)$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$F(\\xi) \\cong \\eta$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{criteria-section-formally-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-smooth-lift-formal}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7264c445308ea583e0eab889e1804962b4eb65c157b299a84efa107ec1216640", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:69a184ae8a69dd4feb0922ed497dbbbd2cb60ce925917c247dc75826448659d3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a <MATH_0003>-morphism of categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a formal object of <MATH_0006>\nand let <MATH_0007> be an object of <MATH_0008> with <MATH_0009>.\nIf <MATH_0010> is formally smooth on objects (see\nCriteria for Representability, Section <REF_0001>),\nthen there exists a formal object <MATH_0011> of <MATH_0012>\nsuch that <MATH_0013>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b433775ba6db88af701a4f28def1eef44abe12a1ec478099cad822c6bfb5caaa", "unit_id": "tag:07X5:statement"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "07X3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m^n) \\to \\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m^{n + 1})$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$F$", "MATH_0004": "$\\xi_1$", "MATH_0005": "$\\xi_2, \\xi_3, \\ldots$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\eta_n|_{\\Spec(R/\\mathfrak m^{n - 1})} \\cong \\eta_{n - 1}$", "MATH_0008": "$F(\\eta_n) \\cong \\xi_n$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4ae8a26416d3ff6160610d77d6306b70f4fa8a819888b9e6995592e69760ff34", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ed952cbd154a968cddfcf5e94c266db34f9f4a30dab8dbf9a25514ebd56c3e2f", "source_text": "Note that each of the morphisms\n<MATH_0001> is a first order\nthickening of affine schemes over <MATH_0002>. Hence the assumption on <MATH_0003> means\nthat we can successively lift <MATH_0004> to objects <MATH_0005>\nof <MATH_0006> endowed with compatible isomorphisms\n<MATH_0007>\nand <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:bc72ee659ce365b525113fa77d84fc93cd007120b4afc38188144e3990d64faf", "unit_id": "tag:07X5:proof"}
